From e26553457769fb870fbbf13c228c6b8b1976ea3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meson Codec <meson-codec@localhost>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 18:16:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: implement fixed-CQP GXL H.264 backend

Port the minimum GXL HCODEC protocol needed for a testable encoder.

Configure Canvas NV12 MFDIN, fixed QP tables, and firmware workspace.

Submit sequence, picture and IDR commands through the mailbox IRQ.
Bound every wait and reset HCODEC after errors.

Emit SPS, PPS and IDR in one V4L2 CAPTURE buffer. This makes the
first output an independently decodable Annex-B access unit.

P-frame state and standard controls follow hardware validation.

Signed-off-by: Meson Codec <meson-codec@localhost>
---
 .../platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c  | 474 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 449 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c
index df66f37..37d6552 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c
@@ -1,12 +1,12 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
